<title>LITHUANIA: CONSTRUCTION PRICES IN APRIL UP BY 0.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>CONSTRUCTION PRICES IN APRIL UP BY 0.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian construction prices in April rose by 0.5 percent on a month-to-month basis and increased by 11.1 percent year-on-year, the country's statistics department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The department also said in a statement that construction prices rose by 2.9 percent in the first four months of the year.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
